	  <br>
            
	<!-- NP v3.8 -->
	<a name="newsitem1012588978,10136,"></a>
<center><table border="0" width="90%" bgcolor="#131F3D" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0"><tr><td>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td><b><font color="#FF0000" size="3">Sayonara Sontalak + Zlandicar</font></b></td></tr><tr><td width="100%" height="1" bgcolor="#FF8040"></td></tr><tr><td><font size="1" color="#999999"><i>Posted by <a href="mailto:aterui@divinewinds.org">aterui</a></i> on Saturday, 2 February 2002 3:42 AM JST</font></td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td class="BODYTEXT"><font color="#EEEEEE">What a fun day! We found Zlandicar up in Dragon Necropolis and killed him quickly!<br><br>Zlandicar dropped <a href=http://www.gameznet.com/eq/equipment/zlandicarstalisman.html>Zlandicar Talisman</a> [Arches] <a href=http://www.gameznet.com/eq/equipment/crackedclawofzlandicar.html>Cracked Claw of Zlandicar</a> [Eason], <a href=http://www.gameznet.com/eq/equipment/gauntletsofmortality.html>Gauntlets of Mortality</a> [Viola],<a href=http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=4778> Zlandicar Heart </a> [Andarius], Fradakar Talisman [Aterui]<br><br>Then we decided to visit the evil dragon of Western Wastes! Today we decided we need revenge so we attacked Sontalak! Sontalak tried to put up a fight by eating some of our players but he finally died!! Grats [Kartang] <a href=http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=5900> Sontalak Talisman</a>  for ST Key. Grats destroy for all crap spells. <br><br><center><br><a href="http://www.divinewinds.org/images/zland01feb.jpg"><img border="0" src="/images/zland01feb.jpg" width="280" height="240"></a><a href="http://www.divinewinds.org/images/sonta01feb.jpg"><img border="0" src="/images/sonta01feb.jpg" width="280" height="240"></a><br></center><br><br></font></td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td></tr></table></center>
<a name="newsitem1011211105,37505,"></a>
<center><table border="0" width="90%" bgcolor="#131F3D" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0"><tr><td>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td><b><font color="#FF0000" size="3">Vaniki, Lendiniara the Keeper, Gozzrem, Telkorenar, Wuoshi all went down in less than 6 hours</font></b></td></tr><tr><td width="100%" height="1" bgcolor="#FF8040"></td></tr><tr><td><font size="1" color="#999999"><i>Posted by <a href="mailto:immort@divinewinds.org">immort</a></i> on Thursday, 17 January 2002 4:58 AM JST</font></td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td class="BODYTEXT"><font color="#EEEEEE">Hehe today marked the first time we killed so many named mobs in a single raid day. Our raid plan was to do Zlandicar before proceeding to clear West ToV. However Vaniki was up and we decided to do it first. Not sure what happened the first time(I wasn't there :P) but Vaniki clearly had no chance against 35 of us the second round hehe. Grats Viola san for winning Willsapper and Bisi who got Vaniki's Heart.<br><br>We wanted to do Zlandicar next but LDT was already camping it so we had no choice but to proceed to West Tov hunting down the rest of our targetted victims(excluding our Victim hehe :P). Started with LtK and it went down with a convincing win on first try with 35 people. It was a good start but the loot suck(watashiwa evil hand TT). Anyway Grats Hideo for getting the ST Talisman, Baystars and Eminor for getting the Boots of Superiority.<br><br>Nxt Gozzrem the AE frost dragon, we were pretty confident as this fight was suppose to be a easier version of the previous one. Sure enough, Gozzrem gave us no trouble and it went down pretty quick. Grats Tadd with the food making Shovel of Harvest that she won't be hungry anymore and Andy with the Wand of the Black Dragon Eye that he can use for Zlandicar raid hehe.<br><br>Telkorenar was suppose to be the last dragon of the day or so it seemed. We were left with 28 people then and there I was getting a little worried. It would be our first serious attempt on West Wing named below the magical 30 mark. There was no time for hesitation and the fight started with uber Aterui pulling Telk out. The fight was wonderful like the previous 2... everyone was doing their role so well that it seemed like we had done this a thousand times... but this time it was Perfect! At the end of the fight Telkorenar lay dead on the ground failing to slay not even one of us. I wish I could record down the memorable and fun fight like a quake demo but alas. Anyway, grats Reiaku for getting the True Mithril Bp and Bisi with the Circlet of Suffering.<br><br>Raid officially ended here but quite a few of us were still in the "dragonslaying" mood. Someone mentioned Wuoshi and we started heading towards WL. By then DW  had only around 15 people but luckily we had Ted Club friends online who were able to join us for the raid. The same usual buffing up and running over to tell Wuoshi that his days were limited. Sure enough, he dropped 3 emerald scales: Kimuri, Mahiru and DW guildbank, Skydarkener: Rafald, CBoL: Dyack, SotED: Henklin.<br><br>Overall it was a fun but tiring day. Now need sleep ZZzz  ^ ^</font></td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td></tr></table></center>
<a name="newsitem1010767794,68118,"></a>
<center><table border="0" width="90%" bgcolor="#131F3D" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0"><tr><td>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td><b><font color="#FF0000" size="3">LtK and Gozzrem down again!</font></b></td></tr><tr><td width="100%" height="1" bgcolor="#FF8040"></td></tr><tr><td><font size="1" color="#999999"><i>Posted by <a href="mailto:immort@divinewinds.org">immort</a></i> on Saturday, 12 January 2002 1:49 AM JST</font></td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td class="BODYTEXT"><font color="#EEEEEE">We went to ToV looking for Ltk and Gozzrem. They were up but unfortunately not for long.In both cases we managed to win on first try and a few selfless acts were seen today :)<br><br>Thanks Nitty for CoH again hehe.<br><br>LtK dead<br><img src="http://www.divinewinds.org/images/110102a.jpg"><br><br>Gozzrem dead<br><img src="http://www.divinewinds.org/images/110102b.jpg"><br><br><u>Loots</u><br><a href="http://eq.gameznet.com/equipment/lendiniarastalisman.html">Lendinara's Talisman</a> : Aterui<br><a href="http://mmo.gameznet.com/eq/new/equipment/lazy/bootsofsuperiority.shtml">Boots of Superiority</a> : Sharo<br><a href="http://mmo.gameznet.com/eq/new/equipment/lazy/glovesofstability.shtml">Gloves of Stability</a> : Motarjafal<br><a href="http://eq.gameznet.com/equipment/veliummaulofsuperiority.html">Velium Maul of Superiority</a> : Immort<br><a href="http://mmo.gameznet.com/eq/new/equipment/lazy/rekekloswarsword.shtml">Rekeklo's War Sword x 2</a> : Kartang Oogagog</font></td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td></tr></table></center>
<a name="newsitem1010597691,74313,"></a>
<center><table border="0" width="90%" bgcolor="#131F3D" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0"><tr><td>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td><b><font color="#FF0000" size="3">West Wing ToV cleared!</font></b></td></tr><tr><td width="100%" height="1" bgcolor="#FF8040"></td></tr><tr><td><font size="1" color="#999999"><i>Posted by <a href="mailto:aterui@divinewinds.org">aterui</a></i> on Thursday, 10 January 2002 2:34 AM JST</font></td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td class="BODYTEXT"><font color="#EEEEEE"><center><a href="http://www.divinewinds.org/images/090102a.jpg"><img border="0" src="/images/090102a.jpg"width="200" height="150"></a><a href="http://www.divinewinds.org/images/090102b.jpg"><img border="0" src="/images/090102b.jpg"width="200" height="150"></a><a href="http://www.divinewinds.org/images/090102c.jpg"><img border="0" src="/images/090102c.jpg"width="200" height="150"></a></center><br><br>A fun day for Divine Winds as we took down all 3 named dragons in West Wing of Temple of Veeshan in one night, for the first time. Also we picked up a Leather Tunic for Hihiee and a Plate Breastplate for Murof along the way. Special Thanks to Nitlan of ToN for dropping everything to CoH us once again!! You guys rock!<br><br><u>Loots</u><br><a href=http://mmo.gameznet.com/eq/new/equipment/lazy/breastplateofsuperiority.shtml>Breastplate of Superiority</a> : Bangaz<br><a href=http://mmo.gameznet.com/eq/new/equipment/lazy/ringofrelkententinar.shtml>Ring of Relkententinar</a> : Henklin<br><a href=http://mmo.gameznet.com/eq/new/equipment/lazy/silvergirdleofstability.shtml>Silver Girdle of Stability</a> : Tadd<br><a href=http://eq.gameznet.com/equipment/lendiniarastalisman.html>Lendinara's Talisman</a> : Nakasan<br><br><a href=http://mmo.gameznet.com/eq/new/equipment/lazy/pauldronsofblight.shtml>Pauldrons of Blight</a> : Rouquinette<br><a href=http://eq.gameznet.com/equipment/necklaceofnightstalking.html>Necklace of Nightstalking</a> : Dyack<br><a href=http://eq.gameznet.com/equipment/necklaceofnightstalking.html>Necklace of Nightstalking</a> : Bisi<br><br><a href=http://mmo.gameznet.com/eq/new/equipment/lazy/circletofsilverskys.shtml>Circlet of Silver Skies</a> : Kazupomu<br><a href=http://eq.gameznet.com/equipment/wandoftheblackdragoneye.html>Wand of Black Dragon Eye</a> : Yumarie</font></td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td></tr></table></center>
<a name="newsitem1010259773,63328,"></a>
<center><table border="0" width="90%" bgcolor="#131F3D" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0"><tr><td>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td><b><font color="#FF0000" size="3">Lendiniara the Keeper Slain!</font></b></td></tr><tr><td width="100%" height="1" bgcolor="#FF8040"></td></tr><tr><td><font size="1" color="#999999"><i>Posted by <a href="mailto:aterui@divinewinds.org">aterui</a></i> on Sunday, 6 January 2002 4:42 AM JST</font></td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td class="BODYTEXT"><font color="#EEEEEE"><center><a href="http://www.divinewinds.org/images/keeper.jpg"><img border="0" src="/images/keeper.jpg"width="504" height="320"></a></center><br><br><u>Loots</u><br><a href=http://mmo.gameznet.com/eq/new/equipment/lazy/breastplateofsuperiority.shtml>Breastplate of Superiority</a> : Hihix<br><a href=http://mmo.gameznet.com/eq/new/equipment/lazy/bootsofsuperiority.shtml>Boots of Superiority</a> : Kukure<br><a href=http://eq.gameznet.com/equipment/lendiniarastalisman.html>Lendinara's Talisman</a> : Osyou<br><a href=http://mmo.gameznet.com/eq/new/equipment/lazy/glovesofstability.shtml>Gloves of Stability</a> : Rafald</font></td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td></tr></table></center>
<a name="newsitem1010168765,75561,"></a>
<center><table border="0" width="90%" bgcolor="#131F3D" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0"><tr><td>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td><b><font color="#FF0000" size="3">Vaniki and Zlandicar Slained</font></b></td></tr><tr><td width="100%" height="1" bgcolor="#FF8040"></td></tr><tr><td><font size="1" color="#999999"><i>Posted by <a href="mailto:immort@divinewinds.org">immort</a></i> on Saturday, 5 January 2002 3:26 AM JST</font></td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td class="BODYTEXT"><font color="#EEEEEE"><a href="http://www.divinewinds.org/images/vaniki.jpg"><img border="0" src="http://www.divinewinds.org/images/vaniki.jpg" width="504"></a><br>Grats to Baystars who just got himself a willsaper today. After killing Vaniki we went on to take down Zlandicar.<br><br><u>loots</u><br><br><a href=http://eq.gameznet.com/equipment/cowlofmortality.html>Cowl of Mortality</a> : Lumica<br><a href=http://eq.gameznet.com/equipment/zlandicarstalisman.html>Zlandicar's Talisman</a> : Dard<br>Zlandicars Heart : Ostracon<br>Fradakars Talisman : Victim<br>FirstBlood Talisman : ????</font></td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td></tr></table></center>
